--TEST--
A literal in a named attribute's payload that is not one of the single-value types its alias names for the field is `E0401` at the payload, at the top level, inside an array and inside a nested shape — `rule:types/single-value-types` and `rule:attributes/attach-sites-and-forms`
--FILE--
<?nvs
type Link = { onRemove?: 'keep'|'clear'|'cascade' };
type Sort = { order: array<'asc'|'desc'>, page: { size: 10|20|50 } };

class Post
{
    #[Link(onRemove: 'drop')]
    public string $author = '';

    #[Sort(order: ['asc', 'up'], page: { size: 20 })]
    public string $title = '';

    #[Sort(order: ['asc'], page: { size: 30 })]
    public string $body = '';
}

echo "unreachable\n";
--EXPECT--

